                <pb facs="0364" n="266" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg266"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Goodnow to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-29"><hi rendition="#italic">August 29,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Japanese consul-general writes me Japanese Government has landed small force Amoy
                    solely to protect consulate and foreign residents. French, English, German
                    cruisers gone there.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Goodnow.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
